# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# crew-research-council
#
# This repo is markdown research output plus the council charter.
# The rules below exist for exactly two reasons: keep credentials
# out of history, and keep machine-local agent state out of it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Secrets — never commit. If any of these ever appear in `git status`,
# stop and check what wrote them.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
auth.json
.ssh/
.gnupg/

# Machine-local agent runtime state.
# NOTE: the durable research output lives in RESEARCH-COUNCIL/ and is
# tracked. Only the volatile state of the tools that generate it is
# ignored here, so a tool's caches never masquerade as project content.
.hermes/.env
.hermes/auth.json
.hermes/profiles/*/.env
.hermes/profiles/*/auth.json
.hermes/profiles/*/attachments/
.hermes/profiles/*/bin/
.hermes/profiles/*/models_dev_cache.json
.hermes/crew/memory/
.hermes/crew/experiment/
.hermes/backups/
.hermes/sessions/
.hermes/cache/
.hermes/state.db*
.hermes/kanban.db*
.hermes/vault/

# 9router runtime — machine-local secrets, DB and vendored deps
.9router/

# Local caches
.local/
.cache/

# SQLite and run artifacts — regenerate from code, never commit
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*huge*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Large one-off archives
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
